      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah that makes sense. i'm specifically worried about those tiny, annoying little bugs that just seem to pop up out of nowhere and mess with the flow, even when the main code looks fine. they're like these little pests in the UI. is there a specific way to categorize those \"nuisance\" bugs vs actual critical failures in a professional audit report?",
      "source": "evaluator"
